# Set these in the BACKEND environment only, then restart the backend.
# Supports LiveKit Cloud or your own LiveKit server. Never commit real credentials.
LIVEKIT_URL=wss://your-project.livekit.cloud
LIVEKIT_API_KEY=
LIVEKIT_API_SECRET=

# Application limit: 10 approved camera/microphone speakers including the host.
# Viewers receive subscribe-only tokens and do not use speaker slots.
# No application viewer cap is imposed. Hosting quotas, bandwidth, and load testing
# determine real capacity; this does not guarantee unlimited simultaneous viewers.
# Until configured, existing small-room peer-to-peer calls remain available,
# while Watch live is disabled instead of sending every viewer peer-to-peer video.
# Deploy the same credentials to each backend environment that serves this site.
